ent-RUMCKitAutomationItem = automation kit
    .desc = A box of the drives, the little circuits and the wiring that make a belt, a sorter or a hand for the factory floor.
ent-RUMCConveyorBeltItem = conveyor belt
    .desc = A tile of belt. Click the floor to put one down; use it in the hand to turn the way it will carry.
ent-RUMCConveyorBeltFastItem = fast conveyor belt
    .desc = A tile of the fast belt. Click the floor to put one down; use it in the hand to turn the way it will carry.
ent-RUMCConveyorBeltTile = conveyor belt
    .desc = Carries what lies on it the way it faces. Right-click it to turn it, or to take it up.
ent-RUMCConveyorBeltTileFast = fast conveyor belt
    .desc = Carries what lies on it the way it faces, twice as quick. Right-click it to turn it, or to take it up.

